    description: "All versions (concept DOI)"
abstract: >-
  Captures eBPF verifier rejections on a pinned kernel, replays any registered
  diagnostic tool on each capture, and scores the source line it names against
  the developer's own fix under three repair-site rules, with chance
  baselines, a second oracle read from the verifier's state, verifier-checked
  rewrites and a control. Ships the 75 upstream bpfix main75 cases, developer-
  fixed rejections from public eBPF projects, and adapters for bpfix, Pretty
  Verifier and PREVAIL.
keywords:
  - eBPF
  - verifier
  - diagnostic localization
  - fault localization
  - metamorphic testing
  - bpfix
